.TH OMORFOS\-PINENTRY 1 "" omorfos "omorfos manual"
.nh
.ad l
.ds AD l
.SH NAME
omorfos\-pinentry \- What gpg\-agent starts to ask for a passphrase, in the sealed prompt of the omorfos desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBomorfos\-pinentry\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
gpg\-agent starts it where \fBpinentry\-program\fR in gpg\-agent.conf names it, and speaks with it on its standard input and output.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print this help
.TP
\fB\-V, \-\-version\fR
Print the version
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBomorfos\fR(1), \fBomorfosctl\fR(1), \fBomorfos\-config\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-keys\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-rules\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-menu\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-theme\fR(5)
